# Qualification output is reproducible and intentionally local.
/qualification/results/

# Benchmark inputs, compiler caches, and evaluation outputs are reproducible
# local data. Their layouts and launch configurations remain tracked. No
# trailing slashes: on quota-limited machines these are symlinks into cold
# storage, and a directory-only pattern leaves the symlink visible.
/benchmarking/datasets
/benchmarking/program_collection/planning_caches
/benchmarking/planning_eval/planning_caches
/benchmarking/planning_eval/results
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
/benchmarking/quickstart_reports/

# Figures, the raw data behind them, and logs. `plot_step_search()` writes
# wherever its caller points it, so the file types are ignored rather than one
# path: none of this belongs in the repository, and all of it is reproducible
# from the artifacts. Force a deliberate exception with `git add -f`.
*.png
*.svg
*.pdf
*.csv
*.log
/figures/
